      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b7b5413ccbaa29a",
      "translationZh": "→ 比 1M 参数的 TinyStories 模型小约 50 倍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11df2ca21d3ef959",
      "translationZh": "→ 比 AlexNet 小约 3,000 倍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "932ef4da94178477",
      "translationZh": "→ 一个解码器块，共享权重，循环应用 4 次",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7532988e821bf60",
      "translationZh": "它显然不是一个通用语言模型，但在其受限的故事分布内，它能够维持一段 100–300 词的叙事，其中包含目标、问题、相关行动和解决结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50b6903544237d38",
      "translationZh": "它在 CPU 上运行也极快，而且不需要 GPU。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75ea3cf48a6470c0",
      "translationZh": "我主要感兴趣的是，连贯叙事生成所需模型规模的下限究竟能被推到多低。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
